{"version":1,"content":"<p>【新紀錄 ✅】1 秒下載 2 萬部 4K 電影，新光纖傳輸紀錄即時速率突破 3.2 Pb/s !! 外媒報道，中國光通信技術和網絡實驗室成功創下全新 24 芯光纖即時傳輸速度的世界紀錄︰3.2 Petabits per second（Pb/s）的即時傳輸速率。</p><p>此速率相當於能在 1 秒鐘內下載超過 2 萬部 4K 解像度電影，或是 1 秒下載 12 萬次 NYDK-54，相較早前創下的 2.5 Pb/s 紀錄大幅躍升近 30%。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T07:22:19.075761+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":216,"images":0,"source":"HKEPC","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T07:11:49+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T23:58:15.633589+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T07:18:18.131193+00:00","content_hash":"f9edba78325e5afe91dd2cde0fce285968a42f97758cc78622419a16f5db041b","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}